#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/mt9v024.rst:2 ../../openmvcam/sensors/mt9v024.rst:6
msgid "Global Shutter Camera Module"
msgstr "全域快門相機模組"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/mt9v024.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Global Shutter Camera Module is a monochrome sensor that captures fast "
"motion without rolling-shutter artifacts. Suited to high-speed tracking, "
"drones, and machine-vision snapshots. The module ships with either the "
"MT9V024 or MT9V034 sensor."
msgstr ""
"全域快門相機模組是一款單色感測器，能捕捉快速運動而不會產生捲簾式快門偽影。適用於高速追蹤、無人機以及機器視覺快照。此模組隨附 MT9V024 或 "
"MT9V034 感測器其中之一。"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/mt9v024.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `Global Shutter Camera "
"Module product page <https://openmv.io/products/global-shutter-camera-"
"module>`_."
msgstr ""
"完整的資料表、照片與訂購資訊請參閱 `全域快門相機模組產品頁面 <https://openmv.io/products/global-shutter-"
"camera-module>`_\\ 。"

